-      "parameter.  This imitates Ifpack, which only implements the power "
-      "method for eigenanalysis.");
+      "Ifpack2::Chebyshev: Ifpack2 only supports \"power method\" and \"cg\" for \"eigen-analysis: type\".");
   }

