+.. math::
+
+  \nabla^2 \phi = \rho.
+
+:cpp:`FFT::Poisson` supports periodic (:cpp:`FFT::Boundary::periodic`),
+homogeneous Neumann (:cpp:`FFT::Boundary::even`), and homogeneous Dirichlet
 (:cpp:`FFT::Boundary::odd`) boundaries using FFT. Below is an example of
